# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestPreArmResponseOmitsForeignHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a PreArm response carries no foreignHigh, so an unarmed activation's free advance passes its duplicate's record
PERTURBS: PreArmAlloc
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ IF FreeOn THEN ReportForeign(a) ELSE UNCHANGED seenP
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no foreignHigh on a PreArm response.
    /\ UNCHANGED seenP
--- END
